{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_121431_p2_b10", "persona_id": "db:2", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 客户要求精确数字时，必须给出具体数值，不能使用‘约’、‘差不多’等模糊表述。若不知道，应坦诚并立即提供现场测试方案。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_121901"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_121431_p2_b10", "persona_id": "db:2", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "2. 避免混淆不同技术参数（如色域覆盖率与耗电数据），否则会严重损害专业形象。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_121901"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_121431_p2_b10", "persona_id": "db:2", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "3. 线下场景应优先使用现场演示、真机对比等直观方式，而非依赖口头数据。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_121901"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_121431_p2_b10", "persona_id": "db:2", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "4. 当客户多次要求同一信息时，应直接满足，而非反复确认或转移话题。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_121901"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_121431_p2_b10", "persona_id": "db:2", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "5. 若无法提供精确数据，可主动提出用专业仪器现场测量，将劣势转化为体验机会。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_121901"}
